omments/117371244","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/2884#issuecomment-117371244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/2884","id":117371244,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDExNzM3MTI0NA==","user":{"login":"DavidAnson","id":1828270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjgyNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1828270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidAnson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-06-30T23:23:49Z","updated_at":"2015-06-30T23:23:49Z","body":"I've included an example below. Note that ~identical files are being linted and the one with LF line endings does not trigger the spaced-comment rule while the one with CRLF line endings does. This seems wrong to me (the rule has nothing to do with line endings) and seems attributable to the absence of '\\r' in the RegExp I changed as part of the associated pull request.\n\n```\nD:\\T\\eslint-2884>npm install eslint@0.24.0\n...\n\nD:\\T\\eslint-2884>type LF.js\n/**\n * This is a function in a file with LF line endings.\n */\nfunction fun() {\n}\n\nD:\\T\\eslint-2884>node_modules\\.bin\\eslint --rule \"strict: 0, no-unused-vars: 0, spaced-comment: 2\" LF.js\n\nD:\\T\\eslint-2884>type CRLF.js\n/**\n * This is a function in a file with CRLF line endings.\n */\nfunction fun() {\n}\n\nD:\\T\\eslint-2884>node_modules\\.bin\\eslint --rule \"strict: 0, no-unused-vars: 0, spaced-comment: 2\" CRLF.js\n\nCRLF.js\n  1:0  error  Expected space or tab after /* in comment  spaced-comment\n\n? 1 problem (1 error, 0 warnings)\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/117371244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"DavidAnson","id":1828270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjgyNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1828270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidAnson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidAnson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":345690261,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM0NTY5MDI2MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/events/345690261","actor":{"login":"nzakas","id":38546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas","html_url":"https://github.com/nzakas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/followers","followin